        {
          "_key": "k000pd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A calm start before school"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000pe",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000pf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If your shift starts before the school day, bring your child to us from 6 am. They can finish a little reading or homework, have breakfast if they are still here at 7:30, and relax with friends until it's time for school."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000pg",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000ph",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What the morning looks like"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000pi",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000pj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Doors open at 6 am. Parents check in with Procare, and children wash their hands and settle in with books, puzzles or quiet play. Breakfast is served from 7:30 to 9 am through the USDA food program (CACFP). A typical breakfast is whole-grain cereal or a muffin with fruit, like peaches or cantaloupe, and milk."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000pk",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000pl",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Schools near the center"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000pm",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000pn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Our center is at 30 W Chestnut Ave in Vineland. Gloria M. Sabater Elementary School is close by, and Compass Academy Charter School is also on W Chestnut Ave. Wherever your child goes to school, school buses can pick up at our center, so ask your district about a stop here."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000po",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000pp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Getting to and from school"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000pq",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000pr",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Parents drop off and pick up at the center, and we do not drive children to or from school. School buses can stop at the center, so ask your school district whether your child's bus can pick up and drop off here."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
